    "scope": "Specific Lotus Temple exterior:27 curved petal shells in three ninefold groups, open porch arches, raised red/white base with continuous glazing bands, nine stepped/ramped approaches and nine independently mapped pools. Fine panel joints, exact shell engineering, hidden interiors and landscaping are omitted. One ordinary exterior picture viewed only; no redistributed pixels or bespoke sources.",
