        "observations": "Cream stone petal shells in tall central, intermediate and low outward-flaring groups; strong pointed ridges, dark open arches between shell feet, broad two-level raised base with white horizontal fascia and red stone bands, central approach stair. Fine panel joints and landscaping are outside the principal medium-fi exterior scope."
